  "_about": "Key paths of upstream kima-hub v1.12.3 (c7527577) podcast responses, read from the BACKEND handlers that build them (each entry's `sources`, path:first-last line at c7527577; frontend/features/podcast/types.ts is a looser client view and is not the reference). Grammar as stats_upstream_keys.json: '.key' object member, '[]' array element, '{}' value of a string-keyed record, 'a|b' allowed JSON types, trailing '?' = upstream may omit the key. Paths below an empty array, a null value or an absent optional key are not observable and not required. `upstream` lists only what upstream sends; `kimaOnly` lists every key kima-rs adds, each with the docs/DIVERGENCES.md row that records it: aiLabel/aiLabelSource/aiHidden (D-207, AI-content labels, owner decision D-200) and the artist rows' trackCount on /library/recently-listened (D-059). `sameShapeAs` reuses another entry (the same route captured in a second case). `stats_spoken` uses stats_upstream_keys.json's stats_response_s1. tools/check-podcast-upstream-keys.py re-checks every upstream key name against the cited source lines of a c7527577 checkout.",
